NOPERM User lab-ro has no permissions to run the 'evalsha' command

> [lab-ro] FCALL rate_limit 1 lab:rl:fcall 5 60000
NOPERM User lab-ro has no permissions to run the 'fcall' command


===== ACL: 함수만 부르는 앱 사용자 (+fcall, 내부 명령 권한 포함) =====
> ACL SETUSER lab-app on >labpw resetkeys ~lab:rl:* -@all +fcall +incr +pexpire +pttl
OK
> [lab-app] FCALL rate_limit 1 lab:rl:app 5 60000
1
60000
> [lab-app] EVAL return 'arbitrary code' 0
NOPERM User lab-app has no permissions to run the 'eval' command

> [lab-app] FUNCTION LOAD REPLACE #!lua name=evil
redis.register_function('f', function() return 1 end)
NOPERM User lab-app has no permissions to run the 'function|load' command

> [lab-app] FCALL rate_limit 1 other:key 5 60000
NOPERM No permissions to access a key


===== ACL: 스크립트 안 명령도 호출자 권한으로 검사한다 (+fcall, -incr) =====
> ACL SETUSER lab-noincr on >labpw resetkeys ~lab:rl:* -@all +fcall +pexpire +pttl
OK
> [lab-noincr] FCALL rate_limit 1 lab:rl:app 5 60000
ERR ACL failure in script: User lab-noincr has no permissions to run the 'incr' command script: rate_limit, on @user_function:7.


===== ACL: +eval 사용자는 임의 코드를 보낼 수 있다 =====
> ACL SETUSER lab-eval on >labpw resetkeys ~lab:rl:* -@all +eval +incr +pexpire +pttl
OK
> [lab-eval] EVAL local count = redis.call('INCR', KEYS[1]) if count == 1 then   redis.call('PEXPIRE', KEYS[1], ARGV[2]) end local remaining = redis.call('PTTL', KEYS[1]) if remaining < 0 then   redis.call('PEXPIRE', KEYS[1], ARGV[2])   remaining = tonumber(ARGV[2]) end if count > tonumber(ARGV[1]) then   return {0, remaining} end return {1, remaining}  1 lab:rl:eval2 5 60000
1
60000
